---
// The algorithmic amplification loop, as an annotated diagram.
const steps = [
  { icon: 'edit', label: 'You post', note: 'curated success or strategic vulnerability' },
  { icon: 'trending_up', label: 'Algorithm amplifies', note: 'high-arousal content wins reach' },
  { icon: 'visibility', label: 'Peers compare', note: 'malicious envy, status anxiety' },
  { icon: 'bolt', label: 'Anxiety rises', note: 'you must not fall behind' },
]
---
<div class="surface p-8 md:p-10 my-12">
  <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8">
    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl">The Engine of Envy</h3>
    <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-surveillance/40 dark:text-cream/40">Fig 03.1</span>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    {
      steps.map((s, i) => (
        <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full bg-rust/10 text-rust flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">{s.icon}</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-display font-bold">{s.label}</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-surveillance/50 dark:text-cream/50 mt-1">{s.note}</span>
          {i < steps.length - 1 && (
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-surveillance/20 dark:text-cream/20 absolute -right-3 top-4 hidden md:block" aria-hidden="true">
              arrow_forward
            </span>
          )}
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-surveillance/10 dark:border-cream/10 flex items-center gap-3 justify-center text-rust font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">loop</span>
    The output (anxiety) becomes the input (more posting). The loop has no exit condition.
  </div>
</div>
